1Ki 21:1 , Ahab being denied Naboth's vineyard, is grieved;
1Ki 21:5 , Jezebel writing letters against Naboth, he is condemned of blasphemy;
1Ki 21:15 , Ahab take possession of the vineyard;
1Ki 21:17 , Elijah denounces judgments against Ahab and Jezebel;
1Ki 21:25 , Wicked Ahab repenting, God defers the judgment.
